SUMMARY:Sonnet 5 intro pricing ends — bump pricing.py to $3/$15
DESCRIPTION:Claude Sonnet 5 introductory pricing ($2/$10 per MTok) ended 2026-08-31.\nUpdate MODEL_RATES_USD_PER_MTOK["claude-sonnet-5"] in pipelines/blog_pipeline/pricing.py from (2.00\, 10.00) to (3.00\, 15.00) so cost-tracking stays accurate. The Director defaults to Sonnet 5\, so this affects its logged cost_usd.
BEGIN:VALARM
ACTION:DISPLAY
DESCRIPTION:In 3 days: Sonnet 5 price bump — update pricing.py claude-sonnet-5 to (3.00, 15.00)
TRIGGER:-P3D
END:VALARM
